• Input: paste, share-target, clipboard prompt, QR scan, batch (one per line), and URLs extracted from any pasted text, HTML, RSS or sitemap. Probe first, then show a preview card: thumbnail, title, uploader, duration, date, chapters, live or premiere flag, formats table, subtitles list.
